# The siege arm that refuses to chase: arty with interception off.
#
# Every screened match logs six hundred to seventeen hundred intercepts --
# the fist spends the decisive window scattered after raiders it mostly
# cannot catch, and the trace autopsies put the loss exactly there: trades
# go bad at samples 1000-1500 while the army is dispersed (log 2026-07-31).
# One field from the round-one leader: the waves ignore raiders entirely
# and the fist stays whole. The extractors will eat more raids; the
# question is whether a whole fist converts more than scattered coverage
# saves.

name aa-counter-guard-arty-noicpt
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
navtilt 0
cover 0
intercept 0
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
hold 0
riposte 0
kite 0
tech 0
lurk 0
allin 0
strike 0
medics 0
navy 0
battery 0
decoys 0
hp_floor 0
bunkers 0
flame 0
close 0
income_ladder 0
guns 0
nukes 0
rebuild 0
